Syntax: vi [<opts>] [<command>] {<path> [<opts>]}Function: edit file(s)Options:     -R           set read only option (view)     -T           write screen output also into file 'trace'     -b[=]<m>[k]  set size of linebuffer to m KByte     -d           turn editor into UNIX-'edit'     -l           set options appropriate for LISP editing     -r           try to recover after crash     -t <tag>     edit file containing <tag>     -w[=]<n>     set default window size to n     -x           turn editor into UNIX-'ex'     -?           show this messageCommand:     +<cmd>       execute cmd after editor is up